        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia European Cylinder Stainless Steel Patio Door Trim Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary stainless steel leversets from Omnia are for use with <b>European Cylinder Below Lever</b> (european profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors. This contemporary Stainless Steel Trim is resistant to corrosion, scratches, abrasion--plus it is stylish. Choose you favorite modern style lever. The Omnia 73000 Series ECB multipoint trim has a satin stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Thru-Bolts</b> are fixed at 9-1/2\" center to center and can not be modified. In some cases new thru-bolting holes must be drilled in your door. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis <b>set does NOT</b> come packaged with the multipoint lock mechanism (the vertical rods found in multipoint patio doors that secure the door to the frame) as those are typically preinstalled in multipoint doors and cannot be replaced. The multipoint trim set is intended to replace the original trim from Hoppe, Hurd, JELD-WEN, Kolbe & Kolbe, Lincoln, Loewen, Peachtree, Norco, Semco, Vetter, Weathershield, Therma-Tru, Willmar, Sierra Pacific, KFV, Simpson, Signature, Crestline, Windsor and others. The <b>Lock to Lever</b> distance is 3-5/8\" (92 mm).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-E08LE1_size.gif?v=1704442260\" width=\"500\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"73000ECB Multipoint Trim Sets dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Also Available: Rounded Patio Trim <a href=\"/products/rounded-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-73000acb\">with <b>American Cylinder Below</b> the lever</a> and <a href=\"/products/rounded-american-cylinder-patio-door-trim-set-omnia-73000aca\">with <b>American Cylinder Above</b> the lever</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Omnia 73000ECB Multipoint Trim Sets\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Stainless Steel Trim</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Satin Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Lock to Lever Spacing: 3-5/8\" (92 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Thru-Bolt Hole Spacing: 9-1/2\"  (242 mm) Center to Center</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\" (280 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-5/8\" (40 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: 7/16\" (10 mm)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Rounded European Cylinder Patio Door Trim Set, Omnia 73000ECB",
                "description": "Omnia 73000ECB multipoint trim sets. These contemporary stainless steel leversets from Omnia are for use with European Cylinder Below Lever (european profile lock cylinder below the door lever) type multipoint mortise locksets commonly found on swinging patio doors. Replace the original trim from Hoppe, Hurd, JELD-WEN, Kolbe & Kolbe, Lincoln, Loewen, Peachtree, Norco, Semco, Vetter, Weathershield, Therma-Tru, Willmar, Sierra Pacific, KFV, Simpson, Signature, Crestline, Windsor and others. The Lock to Lever distance is 3-5/8 inch (92 mm).",
